# Re-aimed (sessions-merge): the table's help lists the where cycle.
#
# History (file name kept for git history):
#   Original: the dashboard's 5-stop source cycle
#     (`all → claude → codex → ecs → managed → all`).
#   2026-07-10: acmeco-qwe renamed to ecs.
#   Later: the cycle restricted to `all → claude → codex → all`.
#   sessions-merge: the dashboard became the sessions table; a source
#     filter is the text filter now (`/ codex`), and the cloud rows are
#     a `where` (all → local → cloud) — the help says so.

write placeholder.txt x
open placeholder.txt

command ai.dashboard

# Open help overlay.
key ?
expect screen contains "Sessions table — help"
expect screen contains "all → local → cloud"
expect screen contains "waiting → live → tool → idle → failed → done"

# Close help.
key ?
expect screen lacks "Sessions table — help"
